  "parent_panel": "<section class=\"panel\" id=\"dynamic-transactions\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">NOTEBOOK126 \u00b7 DYNAMIC TRANSACTIONS</p><h2>Independent point controls and exact rollback</h2><p>The complete declared tiny product passed, and the production graph retained all \\(119633\\) primitive licenses. Independent counts and marking reference counts agree before and after one legal transaction; paired rollback restores the saved state. Whole owned phase: \\(3.445\\,\\mathrm{s}\\); conservative peak: \\(132.0781\\,\\mathrm{MiB}\\). Cluster search, theorem declarations and independent validation advance in parallel; no new proof or RL advantage is claimed.</p><p><a href=\"dynamic-transactions/reader.html#states\">Inspect actual transaction counts</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"dynamic-transactions/reader.html#parallel\">Parallel work</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"dynamic-transactions/reader.html#benchmarks\">Prospective theorem cohort</a></p></section>\n",
